# This fork is pinned to Node 16 (electron-forge 5 / Electron 4). Some modern
# transitive deps (e.g. node-releases, pulled in by a fresh browserslist resolve
# on CI) declare "engines": { "node": ">=18" }. We knowingly build on 16, so
# tell every yarn invocation — including the nested one electron-packager runs
# while pruning the packaged app, which never saw our CLI --ignore-engines — to
# treat that as a warning, not a hard error.
ignore-engines true
